{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/领航信标","pageid":8799,"revid":21674,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%A2%86%E8%88%AA%E4%BF%A1%E6%A0%87&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%A2%86%E8%88%AA%E4%BF%A1%E6%A0%87&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%A2%86%E8%88%AA%E4%BF%A1%E6%A0%87&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>领航信标</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.A2.86.E8.88.AA.E4.BF.A1.E6.A0.87\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"领航信标\"><b>领航信标</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 领航信标.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e8/7tzedi0sqqxw1fs9n8p37audyit2730.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%A2%86%E8%88%AA%E4%BF%A1%E6%A0%87.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e8/7tzedi0sqqxw1fs9n8p37audyit2730.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%A2%86%E8%88%AA%E4%BF%A1%E6%A0%87.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e8/7tzedi0sqqxw1fs9n8p37audyit2730.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />领航信标\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[被动]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（光环）场上所有拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时空漫游\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时空漫游</font></span></span>]的己方释放技能前，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协攻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">协攻</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协防\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">协防</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫属性减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫属性减益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦场上所有&lt;时空旅者&gt;阵营的己方：攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，防御提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>；使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时间回溯\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时间回溯</font></span></span>]或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空穿梭\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空穿梭</font></span></span>]后，攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，持续至战斗结束。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%